      <activity id="f4d59282-db09-5238-986f-5bff31949922" activityNameId="b5430a2b-2569-5557-9e0a-e16a4b6bcdb4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Coffee ground pellets, burned in furnace, produced on site</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Coffee ground pellets, burned in furnace, produced on site
Air emission coffee ground data completed with ecoinvent inventory of "pellets, mixed, burned in furnace 15kW";
UUID: 0fac3d69-7e2b-3de1-90a5-eaccafa3f0d9
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuel input and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: Furnace 25kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0fac3d69-7e2b-3de1-90a5-eaccafa3f0d9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
